## Blog Card CSS

```css
.blog-card {
  background: #06070a;
  border: 1px solid rgba(125, 164, 255, 0.16);
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

.blog-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.blog-image {
  aspect-ratio: 16/9;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.blog-title {
  font-family: "Inter Display";
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #fff;
}

.blog-date {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #9ba9c4;
}
```

---

## Post Content Typography

```css
.post-content {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.post-content h2 {
  font-size: 28px;
  margin-top: 48px;
}

.post-content h3 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

.post-content p {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #ccc;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.post-content ul {
  padding-left: 24px;
}

.post-content li {
  margin: 8px 0;
}
```
